  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Consists of a textile panel (62 x 88 cm.) with 2 grommets at top for hanging and velcro strips at bottom. The textile panel is a screenprint of the shadow of a cross on green grass. Includes three 22 x 28 cm. laminated cards (description of Ardennes American Cemetery, plan of cemetery, picture of shadow of monument on grass in cemetery) with velcro tabs at top so that they can be hung from bottom of textile panel.</subfield>
  </datafield>
